WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
It's a con job.

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.760
At extreme cost and expense,

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:08.480
Europe reduced its own carbon footprint by 37 percent.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:09.720
Think of that.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.040
Congratulations, Europe. Great job.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.280
You cost yourself a lot of jobs, a lot of factories closed,

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.840
but you reduced the carbon footprint by 37 percent.

